{"date":"1995-12-24","platform":"剧场版","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/75/b4/132427_2ClJh.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/75/b4/132427_2ClJh.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/75/b4/132427_2ClJh.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/75/b4/132427_2ClJh.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/75/b4/132427_2ClJh.jpg"},"summary":"　　这一次，华莱士（皮特·塞利斯 Peter Sallis 配音）和他忠心耿耿的狗狗阿高开办了清洁业务。在位羊毛店清洁时，华莱士迷上了女店主温德琳（安妮·雷德 Anne Reid 配音），却不知这家羊毛店正在从事不可告人的勾当。与此同时，华莱士的家来了一名不速之客——小羊肖恩。这个大胃王惹出了不少乱子，却也给华莱士和阿高带来许多乐趣。谁知好景不长，阿高竟被当作杀羊凶手而逮捕，为了救出它，华莱士和肖恩以及其他的绵羊们组织了缜密的营救行动…… \r\n　　本片荣获1996年奥斯卡电影金像奖最佳短片奖、1997年安西国际动画电影节观众奖、1996年英国电影学院奖最佳动画片奖。","name":"Wallace & Gromit: A Close Shave","name_cn":"超级无敌掌门狗：剃刀边缘","tags":[{"name":"短片","count":28,"total_count":101491},{"name":"欧美","count":28,"total_count":86123},{"name":"超级无敌掌门狗","count":19,"total_count":126},{"name":"定格动画","count":17,"total_count":3208},{"name":"黏土动画","count":14,"total_count":79},{"name":"1995","count":12,"total_count":9298},{"name":"奥斯卡","count":11,"total_count":1847},{"name":"英国","count":7,"total_count":752},{"name":"搞笑","count":6,"total_count":631809},{"name":"高智商","count":5,"total_count":38},{"name":"英国动画","count":4,"total_count":47},{"name":"Aardman","count":4,"total_count":45},{"name":"原创","count":3,"total_count":613373},{"name":"赛博狗","count":3,"total_count":3},{"name":"剧场版","count":3,"total_count":718039},{"name":"阿三家神羊","count":2,"total_count":2},{"name":"Gromit","count":2,"total_count":12},{"name":"NickPark","count":2,"total_count":15},{"name":"Wallace","count":2,"total_count":12},{"name":"阿德曼","count":2,"total_count":23},{"name":"SF","count":1,"total_count":7150},{"name":"AnneReid","count":1,"total_count":1},{"name":"1995年","count":1,"total_count":413},{"name":"PeterSallis","count":1,"total_count":1},{"name":"3D","count":1,"total_count":50785},{"name":"TV","count":1,"total_count":1390054},{"name":"&","count":1,"total_count":29},{"name":"Short","cou